      <activity id="432c51c0-dd1a-50f8-ba91-69e90f1f0b32" activityNameId="c7e608c1-1cd4-5172-ad0c-c93a68f6f0c5" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Wood wool, u=20%, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Wood wool, u=20%, at plant
Covers high quality wood wool without shives. The multi-output process "wood wool production, u=20%" delivers the two coproducts "wood wool, u=20%, at plant" and "industrial residue wood, wood wool production, softwood, u=20%, at plant". Allocation is based on the over-all proceeds of the process.;
UUID: e6bceb53-883e-34b3-8b33-686bc80b5f5f
Includes all processes of wood wool production from industrial softwood (debarked), including air drying (from u=70 - 20%), external and internal transports, sucktion, air compression, sawmill production
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Medium enterprise technology (2000)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: personal communication 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the technology is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e6bceb53-883e-34b3-8b33-686bc80b5f5f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
